>> Combination := Lethathamo ncha.

Combination ha-ho-fihla: ['eketsa-qetellong:'] etsa: { :el
	uena 
	fumana: el, Letho? nnete: { uena eketsa-qetellong: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination ncha.
colours
	eketsa-qetellong: ['red'],
	eketsa-qetellong: ['green'],
	eketsa-qetellong: ['blue'],
	eketsa-qetellong: ['red'].

Sephetho ngola: colours, mola-o-mocha.
